# Optional. Point the booth at a different signaling relay than the deployed one.
#
# The deployed relay (relay/) is what the site uses out of the box: no env var is
# required. localhost falls back to an in-browser BroadcastChannel transport so two
# tabs can demo the whole flow with no server running at all.
#
#   npm run relay      # runs the relay in relay/ locally on ws://localhost:8787
#   PUBLIC_SIGNALING_URL=ws://localhost:8787 npm run dev
#
# PUBLIC_SIGNALING_URL=ws://localhost:8787
